    rdfs:label "Signing Failure: ACTIVE+ → STALLED → BLOCKED → SIGNING_BLOCKED" ;
    rdfs:comment "Tracks signing workflow deterioration from an active state through stall to full blockage. In community services, signing blockages most commonly arise from client unreachability, legal capacity questions (dementia, guardianship), or documents arriving in a format the client cannot access (online-only portal for a client without internet). Requires ACTIVE+ baseline before block escalation can arm." ;
